//! Stand-ins for the lane 3 Filmora transitions that have no structural model yet: each
//! is the per-frame global colour mix of the two clips fitted on Filmora's export
//! (`out = aA A + aL luma(A) + bB B + bL luma(B) + o`), which reproduces the timing,
//! the cut and the average brightness and colour of the overlay artwork, not its shapes.
//! Generated by the fitting scripts (docs/fidelity-lane3.md).

